Author: Yifan Zhu <fanzhuyifan@gmail.com>
Date:   Sat Sep 5 21:28:14 2026 -0700

    feat: cancel post-processing and use raw dictation (#166)

    * feat(daemon): resolve active post-processing

    Expose a D-Bus action for resolving an in-flight LLM request and
    pass a per-request cancellation flag through the recognition pipeline.

    Serialize cancellation against normal completion so Escape discards
    the result, while raw fallback is accepted only for dictation.

    * feat(addon): bind post-processing controls

    Handle Escape and Enter while the daemon reports post-processing,
    and show the available actions in the preedit.

    Consume the matching key-release event and use an Escape-only label
    when the active mode cannot be recovered.

